<h1>14_文具、办公、印刷纸品与美术器材 (Stationery, Paper & Art Supplies)</h1>
<p style='color:#64748b;margin-bottom:14px;'>本大类共 <b>24</b> 词（分为 <b>1</b> 个折叠子表，已配图 <b>24</b> 张）• 法语模式已包含 <b>定冠词 le/la + 阴阳词性 (n.m./n.f.) + 雌雄双形态 + 特殊复数</b></p>
<div class="sub-nav"><button class='ctrl-btn' onclick='toggleAllSections(true)'>📂 全部展开</button><button class='ctrl-btn secondary' onclick='toggleAllSections(false)'>📁 全部收起</button><span style='color:#93c5fd;margin:0 4px;'>|</span><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_0')">03_书籍、卡片、票据、地图与印刷纸品 (24)</a></div>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>03_书籍、卡片、票据、地图与印刷纸品 (Books, Maps, Cards & Printed Matter)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 24 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='22%'>单词 (英 / 法性数完整形态)</th><th width='14%'>音标 (英 / 法 IPA)</th><th width='22%'>中文释义</th><th width='24%'>英文定义 (WordNet)</th><th width='6%'>词频</th><th width='12%'>实物配图</th></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>sketch pad<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>le comprimé<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 sketch pad</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/sketʃ pæd/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kɔ̃pʁime/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('sketch pad', 'le comprimé')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>速写本</td><td class='def-en'>a book containing sheets of paper on which sketches can be drawn</td><td>3.76</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_1' data-word="sketch pad" src='images/sketch_pad.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('sketch pad', 'stationery', 'img_1')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>notebook</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le bloc-note<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 notebook</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'nәutbuk/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/blɔk nɔt/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('notebook', 'le bloc-note')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 笔记本, 手册, 期票簿</td><td class='def-en'>a book with blank pages for recording notes or memoranda</td><td>3.74</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_2' data-word="notebook" src='images/notebook.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('notebook', 'stationery', 'img_2')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>coloring book<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la livre de coloriage<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 coloring book</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'kʌlәriŋ buk/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/livʁ də kɔlɔʁjaʒ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('coloring book', 'la livre de coloriage')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>儿童彩色画册</td><td class='def-en'>a picture book with line drawings intended to be colored with crayons by children</td><td>3.58</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_3' data-word="coloring book" src='images/coloring_book.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('coloring book', 'stationery', 'img_3')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>autograph album<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>le liber amicorum<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 autograph album</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˈɔ:təˌgræf ˈælbəm/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/lib amikoʁym/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('autograph album', 'le liber amicorum')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 亲笔签名簿; 纪念册</td><td class='def-en'>an album for autographs</td><td>3.48</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_4' data-word="autograph album" src='images/autograph_album.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('autograph album', 'stationery', 'img_4')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>commonplace book<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la livre<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 commonplace book</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˈkɔmənpleis buk/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/livʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('commonplace book', 'la livre')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 摘录簿</td><td class='def-en'>a notebook in which you enter memorabilia</td><td>3.41</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_5' data-word="commonplace book" src='images/commonplace_book.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('commonplace book', 'stationery', 'img_5')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>contour map<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'isoplèthe<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 contour map</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'kɒntuә mæp/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/izoplɛ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('contour map', 'l\'isoplèthe')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>等高线地图；[计] 等值线图</td><td class='def-en'>a map having contour lines through points of equal elevation</td><td>3.35</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_6' data-word="contour map" src='images/contour_map.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('contour map', 'stationery', 'img_6')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
